w.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=095fd538-6e08-4480-9795-3d6c9607cc85.pdf"},{"period":"Feb 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=0fa40d4c-f4d4-4d36-80cc-86be1f64817e.pdf"}]},"as_of":"2026-11-15T18:53:32+05:30","research":{"summary":"Asian Paints is India's leading decorative paints company, also present in industrial coatings (via two JVs), international operations, and home decor (bath, kitchen). Q2 FY27 saw strong top-line growth (standalone net sales +14.8%, decorative volume +6.4%) but gross margin dipped as price hikes lagged raw material inflation.","how_it_makes_money":"Primarily decorative paints sold through a wide distribution network, supplemented by industrial/B2B coatings (two JVs: PPGAP auto refinish and general industrial), international operations (~30% Q2 growth), and bath/kitchen decor businesses.","bull":[{"point":"Strong volume growth despite steep price hikes","quote":"we have been able to grow at a good volume of about 6.4% at the base of the last year, which was almost about an 11% growth","page":14,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"},{"point":"VAE backward integration commissioned, expected to cut costs","quote":"it should really give us some advantage of 300 bps to 500 bps on relevant products","page":28,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"},{"point":"New products now a large share of revenue","quote":"the new products contribute to about 18% of the revenues which just shows that the innovation cycle, what we speak is very strong","page":16,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"}],"bear":[{"point":"Price hikes not covering inflation; gross margin dipped","quote":"we have taken a 7% price increase in quarter one, almost about a 5% price increase in quarter two, but it doesn't match the inflation","page":21,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"},{"point":"Anti-dumping duty on TiO2 adds 2-3% cost","quote":"it could have an impact from anywhere between 2% to 3% of the overall thing","page":30,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"},{"point":"Industrial and international margins lag on price pass-through","quote":"In JV2, which is the APPPG, there has been a greater lag of seeing some of those increases","page":29,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"}],"watch":[{"point":"Whether Q3 festive/wedding demand delivers 8-9% volume growth","quote":"it would be reasonable to expect to see a volume growth of about 8% to 9% going forward","page":29,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"},{"point":"Whether EBITDA margin holds the 18-20% band amid inflation and ADD","quote":"for the year we should be able to maintain the band of what we have spoken of 18% to 20%","page":28,"url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ee7e6efe-1f9b-4b5e-bff7-1da18902ffeb.pdf","source":"Earnings call, Nov 2026"}],"sources":["Earnings call, Nov 2026"],"as_of":"2026-11-15T18:53:38+05:30"}}